Ezek 17:3 , terebinth 2Sam 18:9 , substance Gen 15:14 , wealth Dan 11:2 , victory 1Sam 19:5 , 22 הַגָּדוֺל בּוֺר read ׳ב הַגֹּרֶן according to ᵐ5 We Dr. 2 in number , e.g. nation Gen 12:2 , congregation Jer 31:8 , camp 1Chr 12:22 , army Ezek 17:17 , sacrifice 2Kin 10:19 , slaughter Deut 28:59 ; 1Sam 4:17 . 3 in intensity , fear Deut 4:34 , weeping Isa 38:3 , power כּחַ Exod 32:11 , joy Jonah 4:6 , anger Deut 29:23 , indignation Jer 21:5 , sin Gen 20:9 , iniquity 4:13 , evil 39:9 , trespass Ezek 9:7 . 4 in sound, loud voice Gen 39:14 , cry Exod 11:6 , shout Josh 6:5 . 5 in age , elder, eldest, son Gen 27:1 , daughter 29:16 , brother 10:21 , sister Ezek 16:46 . 6 in importance , a. things (הַ)גָּדֹל (הַ)דָּבָר an important thing or affair Exod 18:22 ; Deut 4:32 ; 1Sam 12:16 ; 2Kin 5:12 ; 8:13 ; יהוה יום Jer 30:7 ; Hosea 2:2 ; Joel 2:11 ; 3:4 ; Zeph 1:14 ; Malachi 3:23. b. of men, great, distinguished , Moses Exod 11:3 , David 2Sam 5:10 , Job Job 1:3 , Mordecai Est 9:4 , kings Eccl 9:14 ; Jer 27:7 ; especially of king of Assyr. הַגָּדוֺל הַמֶּלֶךְ 2Kin 18:19 , 28 = Isa 36:4 , 18 , = Assyrian šarru rabbu, šarru dannu, e.g. KB i. 94, 1. 1 ; הַגָּדוֺל הַכֹּהֵן the h.p. Lev 21:10 20 t.; גָּדוֺל (הָ)אִישׁ 1Sam 25:2 ; 2Sam 19:33 ; 2Kin 5:1 ; גְדוֺלָה אִשָּׁה 4:8 ; גָּדוֺל a great man 2Sam 3:38 ; Micah 7:3 ; גָדוֺל מְּנֵי תֶהְדַּר לֹא thou shalt not honour (favour) the person of a great man (opposed to דָּל ) Lev 19:15 (H); (הַ)גְּדוֺלִים the great 2Sam 7:9 = 1Chr 17:8 ; Neh 11:14 (see below) Prov 18:16 ; 25:6 ; Jer 5:5 ( 2Kin 10:11 ᵐ5 L ἀγχιστεύοντας , Klo גֹּאֲלָיו ); further הָעִיר גְּדֹלֵי 10:6 ; (כָּלֿ)גְּדֹלָיו 10:11 ; Jonah 3:7 ; גְּדוֺלֶיהָ כָּלֿ Nahum 3:10 . c. of God, himself 2Chr 2:4 ; Neh 4:8 ; 8:6 ; Psa 86:10 ; 99:2 ; 135:5 ; 147:5 ; Isa 12:6 ; Jer 10:6 ; (הַ)גָּדוֺל (הָ)אֵל Deut 7:21 ; 10:17 ; Neh 1:5 ; 9:32 ; Psa 77:14 ; 95:3 ; Jer 32:18 ; Dan 9:4 ; האלהים מכל גדול Exod 18:11 ; מאד ומהלל גדול 1Chr 16:25 ; Psa 48:2 ; 96:4 ; 145:3 ; גדול מלך 47:3 ; 95:3 ; Mal 1:14 ; his works Deut 11:7 ; Judg 2:7 ; Psa 111:2 , glory 21:6 ; 138:5 , name Josh 7:9 ; 1Sam 12:22 ; 1Kin 8:42 ; 2Chr 6:32 ; Psa 76:2 ; 99:3 ; Jer 10:6 ; 44:26 ; Ezek 36:23 ; Mal 1:11 (twice in verse), mercy 1Kin 3:6 ; 2Chr 1:8 ; Psa 57:11 ; 86:13 ; 108:5 , goodness Neh 9:25 , compassion Isa 54:7 . 7 in phrases גָּדוֺל הַיּוֺם עוֺד it is yet high day (French grand jour , German hoch am Tage , the day is at its height) Gen 29:7 ; כַּגָּדֹל כַּקָּטֹן (or reverse) as well small as great Deut 1:17 ; 1Chr 25:8 ; 26:13 ; 2Chr 31:15 ; גָּדוֺל וְעַד (לְ)מִקָּטֹן (or reverse) from small to great Gen 19:11 ; 1Sam 5:9 ; 30:2 , 19 ; 2Kin 23:2 ; 25:26 ; 2Chr 15:13 ; 34:30 ; Est 1:5 , 20 ; Jer 6:13 ; 8:10 ; 31:34 ; 42:1 , 8 ; 44:12 ; Jonah 3:5 . 8 construct (הַ)כְּנָפַיִם גְּדֹל great of wings Ezek 17:8 , 7 , so of anger Prov 19:19 (Qr); usually of God, in power Nahum 1:3 , counsel Jer 32:19 , mercy Psa 145:8 . 9 as substantive concrete גדלות עשׂה do great things , of God's great acts of redemption and judgement Deut 10:21 ; Job 5:9 ; 9:10 ; 37:5 ; Psa 71:19 ; 106:21 ; of the miracles of Elisha 2Kin 8:4 ; of things too great and so presumptuous, haughty ג ׳תבקשׁ Jer 45:5 ; ג ׳מדברת Psa 12:4 ; לא בג ׳הלכתי 131:1 (compare Biblical Aramaic Dan 7:8 , 11 , 20 ; also Rev 13:5 ). 10 as substantive neuter greatness of arm Exod 15:16 ; compare גָּבֹהַּ 4","rootNote":"or גָּדֹל ; (shortened) from 1431 ;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Chr 11 9","keyReferences":["1Chr 11 9","1Chr 11 14","1Chr 12 15","1Chr 12 23","1Chr 16 25","1Chr 17 8","1Chr 22 8","1Chr 25 8"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":530,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Chr 11 9","book":"1Chr","chapter":11,"verse":9,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וְ/גָד֑וֹל","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Vqa"},{"reference":"1Chr 11 14","book":"1Chr","chapter":11,"verse":14,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"גְדוֹלָֽה","source":"hebrew","morph":